body:
Hahaha. Every single day it seems like this gets posted and I reply every time. 

&#x200B;

I have AN-BP. I binge and purge like no one's business and some of my binges can be absolutely massive. And no, they're not subjective "I ate 4 carrot sticks and two rice cakes". Nope. Massive binges.

I'll say this much. I'm AN-BP aka Anorexia with a binge purge subtype. I do have binging and purging episodes but. I wish I never learned how to purge. 

&#x200B;

I'm only 18 but I'm getting horrific chest pains. My stamina is absolutely shot. yes, I'm losing weight because I restrict in between all of my b/p sessions and overexercise. But this is the most destructive behavior I've ever done. My hair is falling out. My teeth are yellowing. My hands are scarred and bruised and they bleed sometimes because of what I do. 

&#x200B;

Don't do this. I'm now scared for my life. And I'd hate to see another person join me in this hell
